00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:11.860
We have a paper character, first person character, and so on.

41
00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:18.860
So this is useful because it shows us every class which is within the system.

42
00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.060
Now, we can have extra classes

