50
00:03:56.360 --> 00:04:00.360
This gives us an opportunity to have a look at the interface.

51
00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:06.219
So for the Blueprint interface, what we have here across the top

52
00:04:06.219 --> 00:04:08.219
