55
00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.220
To start with, we have Save.

56
00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:23.220
Just saves the asset or the work you've done to disk.

57
00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:26.220
Next up, we have Browse To.

58
00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:30.220
And this is useful because say we're in an odd directory here,

59
00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:34.259
