60
00:04:34.259 --> 00:04:36.259
I could hit Browse To,

61
00:04:36.259 --> 00:04:39.259
and it will automatically browse to that asset

62
00:04:39.259 --> 00:04:42.449
and allow me to drag that into the world.

63
00:04:42.449 --> 00:04:46.259
So that's the Browse To.

64
00:04:46.259 --> 00:04:48.259
