71
00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:19.930
If I hit Compile, this runs fine.

72
00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.149
So I'm going to find a node which didn't.

73
00:05:22.149 --> 00:05:29.220
So, OK, here you go.

74
00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.250
Add input vector, that calls.

75
00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:35.250
Our third condition is this red mark here,

76
00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:39.250
which says there was an error during compilation.

77
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.250
See log for details.

78
00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.250
So this is your code has not compiled and it has broken.

79
00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:50.250
You'll see down here in the compiling results at the bottom,

80
00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.250
